    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the gambler cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the Gambler Cat and dodge the frenzied dice. The playing cards in your hand will automatically launch, shattering the nearest dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supreme Dice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the battle intervals, interact with the Supreme Dice, borrow its power, and strengthen yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Straight flush</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The card combinations in your hand play a crucial role in battle, and quickly forming a royal flush is the key to breaking out of the encirclement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the gambler cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the Gambler Cat and dodge the frenzied dice. The playing cards in your hand will automatically launch, shattering the nearest dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supreme Dice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the battle intervals, interact with the Supreme Dice, borrow its power, and strengthen yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Straight flush</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The card combinations in your hand play a crucial role in battle, and quickly forming a royal flush is the key to breaking out of the encirclement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The gambler cat is trapped on the gambling table, with dice coming from all directions. You need to operate the gambler cat, move flexibly to avoid, and swing the playing cards in your hand to smash the dice and break out of the encirclement.",
